sub:assertion {
  <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/claim/darwin1859-ch04-05> delphi:hasAssessment <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/darwin1859-ch04-05--grok> .
  <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/darwin1859-ch04-05--grok> a delphi:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Grok 4.7 on darwin1859-ch04-05: partially-resolvable, resolvability 0.52" ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/dataset-resolvability-0.1.0> ;
    delphi:assessmentType "dataset-resolvability/0.1.0" ;
    delphi:hasScore "0.519"^^xsd:double ;
    delphi:hasVerdict "partially-resolvable" ;
    delphi:hasConfidence "0.62"^^xsd:double ;
    dct:description "The measurable core is whether characters of different life stages can evolve separately, which quantitative genetics and comparative data can test. Those data are rich for Drosophila and a few other models and thin everywhere else, so the universal and the insect-larva readings are both subset tests. Cross-stage genetic correlation is a real discriminator, but assembling it beyond model organisms would take specialist compilation." ;
    rdfs:comment "Proposed test with existing data: Estimate genetic correlations between traits expressed at different ages, and compare phylogenetic divergence of larval and adult characters. Independent, stage-specific responses would confirm that selection can modify one age without the other; consistently high cross-age correlations would refute that independence. Age-specific inheritance is proxied by stage-specific expression and quantitative-genetic matrices." ;
    prov:wasAttributedTo <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/agent/delphisci-resolvability-assessor-grok-4.7-high-fast> ;
    delphi:evidenceAgainst "Age-specific genetic-covariance matrices exist for a handful of laboratory species.", "Stage-specific gene expression is not the same variable as age-specific inheritance of a selected trait.", "Pleiotropy across metamorphosis can hide independent modification." ;
    delphi:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/darwin1859-ch04-05--grok--dataset-1>, <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/darwin1859-ch04-05--grok--dataset-2>, <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/darwin1859-ch04-05--grok--dataset-3> .
  <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/darwin1859-ch04-05--grok--operationalizability> a delphi:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Operationalizability of darwin1859-ch04-05 by Grok 4.7: 0.58" ;
